  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dataButton: {fileID: 666107793}
  plotButton: {fileID: 943326881}
  inventory: {fileID: 1226686532}
  boxDisplay: {fileID: 814789075}
  saveButton: {fileID: 1672573349}
  menuButton: {fileID: 644659587}
  questButton: {fileID: 1032745220}
  seasonDesc:
  - You have harvested your first crop! Go to the market to sell your corn and buy
    new items.
  - You have earned a new tool! Now you can add additional water to each plot. Click
    on the DATA button in the bottom left corner to determine how much you should
    water!
  - It looks like there is a drought this season. Click the watering can and then
    any plot to provide it with more water. Additional water can be purchased in the
    market.
  - A new crop has been unlocked in the market!
  - You have run out of funds and seeds! As you can no longer maintain the operating
    costs, you are forced to sell the farm.
  - You've unlocked a new tool! Click on the fertilizer that has appeared in your
    inventory, and then click on the plot you would like to apply it to. Fertilizer
    increases the nitrate levels of the plots.
  - You can now buy a composter at the market! This upgrade will slow the nitrate
    depletion of your plots by half, so you won't have to use as much fertilizer.
  - 'You have unlocked a new tool! Click on the pesticides in your inventory to prevent
    insects from appearing on a plot. Hint: A plot has been affected by pests if the
    fully grown crop appears with black dots.'
  - Have you found the quest button on the right side of your screen? Quest completion
    will be checked at the END of each season. Make sure to check back frequently
    to claim your rewards!
